---
description: type rules
alwaysApply: true
---
use Zod validated types from the shared/schema package
Prefer Zod types over locally defined types
Use `interface` for props and `type` for unions; always prefer explicit over inferred types for public APIs
avoid the use of 'any' and 'unknown' types
Use a functional component written in TypeScript with typed props
Use an `index.ts` file in each feature folder to re-export module elements for cleaner imports.
Do not re-export types imported from other packages
